                                        <td class="class11">
• Non-Banking Financing Entities: <a href="https://www.acuite.in/view-rating-criteria-44.htm" target="_blank" style="color:blue;font-size:12px !important;">https://www.acuite.in/view-rating-criteria-44.htm</a><br>• Default Recognition: <a href="https://www.acuite.in/view-rating-criteria-52.htm" target="_blank" style="color:blue;font-size:12px !important;">https://www.acuite.in/view-rating-criteria-52.htm</a><br>• Application Of Financial Ratios And Adjustments: <a href="https://www.acuite.in/view-rating-criteria-53.htm" target="_blank" style="color:blue;font-size:12px !important;">https://www.acuite.in/view-rating-criteria-53.htm</a><br>• Consolidation Of Companies: <a href="https://www.acuite.in/view-rating-criteria-60.htm" target="_blank" style="color:blue;font-size:12px !important;">https://www.acuite.in/view-rating-criteria-60.htm</a><br>                                        </td>
